message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and also cite the data providers and the baseline forecasts you use (see DATA-SOURCES.md)."
title: "Knotenlinie"
abstract: "An open earthquake-forecasting research codebase: daily ETAS-class and long-term smoothed-seismicity and fault-based models for Italy, southern California and New Zealand, scored with CSEP-standard tests against named baseline forecasts."
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-16"
authors:
  - name: "Knotenlinie contributors"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/erdem-afk/knotenlinie"
url: "https://github.com/erdem-afk/knotenlinie"
keywords:
  - earthquake forecasting
  - ETAS
  - CSEP
  - seismicity
  - statistical seismology
